  // leaves a stat untouched, low credibility pulls it most of the way to
  // baseline, rather than feeding an unproven outlier value through at full
  // strength.
  // Floored at 0.5 rather than running all the way to 0: low credibility
  // used to be able to replace a stat almost entirely with a generic
  // roster-average baseline, which silently treats "small/unproven sample"
